The name of a property to be assigned to the main namespace to gain a reference to
this application. Can be set to an empty value to prevent the reference from
being created

    Ext.application({
        name: 'MyApp',
        appProperty: 'myProp',

        launch: function() {
            console.log(MyApp.myProp === this);
