`this.self` is scope-dependent and it's meant to be used for dynamic inheritance. See {@link Ext.Base#method!statics Ext.Base#statics}
for a detailed comparison

    Ext.define('My.Cat', {
        statics: {
            speciesName: 'Cat' // My.Cat.speciesName = 'Cat'
        },

        constructor: function() {
            alert(this.self.speciesName); // dependent on 'this'
