        items   : [
            {
                xtype: 'button',
                text : 'My Button'
            }
        ]
    });

A useful option of Button is the {@link #cfg!scale #scale} configuration. This configuration has three different options:

- `'small'`
- `'medium'`
- `'large'`

Example usage:

    @example
    Ext.create('Ext.Button', {
