In this example we create an axis of Numeric type. We set a minimum value so that
even if all series have values greater than zero, the grid starts at zero. We bind
the axis onto the left part of the surface by setting `{@link #cfg!position position}` to `left`.
We bind three different store fields to this axis by setting `{@link #cfg!fields fields}` to an array.
We set the title of the axis to _Number of Hits_ by using the `{@link #cfg!title title}` property.
